<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-PERU BEAT ARGENTINA 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU BEAT ARGENTINA 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SUCRE, Bolivia 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru beat Argentina 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a Copa America quarter-final Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Peru - Eddie Carazas (30), Martin Hidalgo (62)</p>
<p>Argentina - Marcelo Gallardo (72, penalty)</p>
